{
    "id": "334",
    "code": "334",
    "title": " 334  Gracias Diosman Kachun",
    "musicalNote": " (Mi Menor)",
    "chorus": [],
    "paragraphs": [
        {
            "id": "3241",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " Gracias Diosman kachun, Pay pusawampuni\nCristopi a ti pay man,"
        },
        {
            "id": "3242",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " /ima ruwaypipis Cristoman rikuchiy\nMunasqanman jina./"
        },
        {
            "id": "3243",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " Gracias Diosman kachun; kawsayta qowanchej,\nCristo Jesusnejta."
        },
        {
            "id": "3244",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " /ima ruwaypipis Cristoman rikuchiy\nMunasqanman jina./"
        },
        {
            "id": "3245",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " Qhatiypuni, hermano; ñak'ariy kajtimpis,\nSeñor jamonqaña."
        },
        {
            "id": "3246",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " /ima ruwaypipis Cristoman rikuchiy\nMunasqanman jina./"
        },
        {
            "id": "3247",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " Mas doy gracias a Dios que nos lleva siempre\nTriunfo en Cristo Jesús."
        },
        {
            "id": "3248",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " /&quot;Por medio nosotros manifiesta siempre\nGrato olor de Cristo &quot; ./"
        },
        {
            "id": "3249",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " Gracias, gracias a Dios por este olor de vida,\nDe parte de Cristo."
        },
        {
            "id": "3250",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " /&quot;Por medio nosotros manifiesta siempre\nGrato olor de Cristo &quot; ./"
        },
        {
            "id": "3251",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " Sigue, sigue, hermano El Señor por ti viene,\nPronto gozaremos."
        },
        {
            "id": "3252",
            "chorusPos": [],
            "paragraph": " /&quot;Por medio nosotros manifiesta siempre\nGrato olor de Cristo &quot; ./"
        }
    ]
}